// Run before re-running load_all.gsql. 4.2.5 rejects CREATE OR REPLACE on a
// loading job, and CREATE on an existing name is a hard error, so a reload
// starts here.
USE GRAPH FraudInvestigation
DROP JOB load_customers
DROP JOB load_cards
DROP JOB load_devices
DROP JOB load_transactions
DROP JOB load_closed_cases
